Package: libqtghostty0
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Qt wrapper library for Ghostty terminal emulator
 libqtghostty is a reusable Qt wrapper around libghostty-vt.
 It provides PTY session management and terminal widget rendering
 for Qt6-based applications.

Package: libqtghostty-dev
Architecture: any
Section: libdevel
Depends: libqtghostty0 (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Description: Development files for libqtghostty
 This package contains the headers and development symlink
 for the libqtghostty shared library.

Package: deepin-terminal-ghostty
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libqtghostty0 (= ${binary:Version})
Description: Deepin terminal emulator based on Ghostty
 deepin-terminal-ghostty is a Linux terminal emulator built with
 C++20, Qt6 Widgets, DTK6, and libghostty-vt.
 .
 It provides a tabbed terminal interface with deepin-style UI
 integration.
